  "changes": [
    "One toolbar: Front, Side, Top, Device labels, Status and Reset view.",
    "Recovery and diagnostics in a collapsed troubleshooting menu for every task.",
    "A shared status panel for process, devices, workpieces, current violations and task-specific readings.",
    "Independent functional-device selection, shared name badges and tint; support furniture and workpiece visuals excluded.",
    "A shared execution selector and condition-scoped PASS/FAIL display; sparse-scan-safe failure seeking.",
    "A shared Machine inspector lists selectable equipment, recorded selected-device state and explicit I/O, then nonempty relationships. Composite cell anchors and workpieces are not device rows.",
    "Functional equipment selection groups component objects by recorded axis and assembly-instance identity. Independent axes and sensors remain separate; repeated device types receive distinct labels.",
    "Recorded detector bodies remain selectable independently of mount-related names; the approach tool is grouped with its recorded Z axis."
